><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Compliance Calendar Set</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="5" y="15" width="35" height="50" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="43" y="15" width="35" height="50" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="81" y="15" width="34" height="50" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="22" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">FD/RD</text><text x="60" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Loans</text><text x="98" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">NDH-1</text><text x="22" y="50" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Deposits</text><text x="60" y="50" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Gold/Prop</text><text x="98" y="50" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Comply</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Fully Operational</span><span class="step-number-large">06</span></div></div></div>

